  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lokamarinyang Self Help Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lokamarinyang Self Help group is composed of widows in the remote Northeastern corner of Turkana County, whose spouses have died in cattle raids. Grant funding will cover a feasibility study to assess the best options for irrigation infrastructure on their farm.</narrative>
  </description>
